      "text": "terraform   creates every AWS resource below  (1)\naws cli     uploads the six documents and manifest  (2)\ndocker      builds rag-api and pushes it to ECR  (3)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 4,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "terraform   creates every AWS resource below  (1)\naws cli     uploads the six documents and manifest  (2)\ndocker      builds rag-api and pushes it to ECR  (3)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
