      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 826173277,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 578745041,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1754500000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Platform and identity",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 4,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Platform and identity",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "h2704888330",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 377,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 519220408,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 493908485,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1754500000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5  the API server drives each node's kubelet:\n    schedules pods, carries port-forward\n6  kubelet pulls the image with the node role\n7  EBS CSI creates and attaches the gp3 disk\n8  Secrets encrypted with KMS; logs to CloudWatch\n9  a pod presents its service account token\n10 STS checks the role trusts rag:rag-api from\n    this cluster, returns 1-hour credentials",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 4,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5  the API server drives each node's kubelet:\n    schedules pods, carries port-forward\n6  kubelet pulls the image with the node role\n7  EBS CSI creates and attaches the gp3 disk\n8  Secrets encrypted with KMS; logs to CloudWatch\n9  a pod presents its service account token\n10 STS checks the role trusts rag:rag-api from\n    this cluster, returns 1-hour credentials",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "h4789064019",
